: 1994182, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16qpy.jpg"}, {"id": 1994179, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16qpv.jpg"}], "slug": "gelatia", "storyline": "Gelatia was the sweetest land in the world, until Witch Acidella came by with a squirt of lemon. Drop by drop, its creatures turned sour and grumpy. Grandma Cream finds the last drop of sweet jelly, a small slime knight, and sends him out to sweeten them again, land after land.", "summary": "Gelatia is a side-view idle RPG in which a small slime knight sweetens sour monsters instead of slaying them. The hero fights on his own, even while the game is closed, and the player decides how to spend the gold and gems he collects: upgrading his stats, summoning weapons, armor, skills and companions, and choosing when to rebirth for permanent bonuses.\n\nThe journey crosses thirty candy-themed lands, each guarded by a boss waiting to be sweetened. Alongside it, the game offers a tower of bosses, daily dungeons, a mine with research, arena battles against other players' teams, and guilds that fight weekly bosses together.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gelatia", "videos": [{"id": 203844, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "X_6-ZgXr61A", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X_6-ZgXr61A", "title": "Gelatia: don't defeat monsters, sweeten them | Trailer #idlerpg", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X_6-ZgXr61A/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}